# Historical research campaign dumps are not publication data; the single
# source of truth is the Neon ledger (jsonl backup lives in artifacts/). Only
# the fp211 audit (the --verify-committed hash anchor) and the round11 ranking
# module (rank.py, unit-tested) remain tracked. Keep everything else local-only;
# re-add deliberately when a future audit needs the raw dump.
research/*
!research/orchestrator-260813-fp211-audit/
!research/round11-top500-20260829/
research/round11-top500-20260829/*
!research/round11-top500-20260829/rank.py
docs/research/
.neon

